{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40355","headline":"江南行 · 许昼","name":"江南行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南萧洒地，本自与君宜。\n固节还同我，虚心欲待谁。\n涧泉傍借响，山木共含滋。\n粉腻虫难篆，丛疎鸟易窥。\n尽应逢野渡，中忽见村祠。\n叶扫秋空静，根横古堑危。\n影迷寒霭里，声出夜风时。\n客棹深深过，人家远远移。\n游边曾结念，到此数题诗。\n莫恨成龙晚，成龙会有期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}